
### Check whether PrepX-AI API is running
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### Check API documentation is available
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/openapi.json

### Start an interview (may fail until model training)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/question/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "interview_category": "Software Development",
    "job_role": "Python Developer",
    "difficulty_level": "medium"
}
